# rules_applecross's ported tools (the clean-room actool, ibtool, codesign
# and the rest, built for Linux) by their SHA-256, for MODULE.bazel's
# apple_cross_toolchain.configure: its ported-tools workflow's archives from
# its main at 0785e7f, whose codesign seals a Mac app's nested code (the
